In csh and tcsh, do the following to put both stdout and stderr
to the same file:

        fort program.for >& errorfile

If you want to put stdout in one file and stderr in another, do
the following:

        ( fort program.for > stdoutfile ) >& stderrfile

Most of this syntax, and more, can be found in man pages for your
shell and/or its commands.

Robert Riches
richesr1@inetarena.com



