Hi there!
For me it is:
'make config' (anything else was considered buggy in the past)
'make dep'
'make clean' 
'make boot' (this is the built target that should work on all
archtectures (right?))
'make modules'
'make modules_install'
or you can 'unify' the command to:
'make config'
'make dep clean boot modules modules_install'
aNd have a look at www.alphalinux.org. They have some information about
linux on alphas, including some documentation about kernel compilation.

