Let it go.. Deskstation Technology is gone, the specs on the board are 
proprietry, it has ARCS BIOS (note the "S") and because of that it 
cannot run any *BSD, Tru64 UNIX, or OpenVMS. So unfortunately there has 
never been Linux support for these systems. The way it currently stands, 
only a dead-end version of Window$ NT will run on it (M$ quit supporting 
Alpha some time ago). 

